@startuml
!include ../iris-style.puml
skinparam ranksep 24
title D-17  Manuscript processing: upload to searchable passages
caption From apps/documents/tasks.py, apps/ai/tasks.py, apps/records/tasks.py, CELERY_TASK_ROUTES and ADR-052, ADR-054, ADR-056, ADR-058 on main (IR-1021).\nEach step names, in bold, the service that runs it (IR-1022: one column instead of seven swimlanes).

start
:<b>Author</b>\nUpload the manuscript PDF;
:<b>Django (backend)</b>\n1. Check it is a real PDF, at least one page, at most 50 MB (validators, IR-665)\n2. Save the Version and its file;
fork
  :<b>celery-default</b>\nread_review_text: pdfplumber on campus\n(no AI, every Version, ADR-058);
  detach
fork again
  :<b>celery-extraction</b>\nextract_manuscript_text;
end fork
if (Embargo released and Contact person\nanswered Yes to AI use? (ADR-052, ADR-054)) then (yes)
  :<b>celery-extraction</b>\nAdmit the paid call when provider\nadmission is enforced (ADR-041);
  :<b>LlamaParse</b> (external)\nParse the PDF into structure;
  :<b>celery-extraction</b>\nStore PdfExtraction and Figures;
else (no)
  :Stop: nothing leaves campus;
  stop
endif
:<b>celery-default</b>\n1. chunk_extraction: labelled-structure chunks (voyage-context-4 tokens, ceiling 700)\n2. Swap in the new ChunkSet atomically;
:<b>celery-embedding</b>\nembed_chunk_set;
:<b>Voyage AI</b> (external)\nContextualized chunk embeddings;
:<b>celery-embedding</b>\n1. Store ChunkEmbedding (pgvector, HNSW)\n2. generate_record_overview (needs a summary model);
:<b>AI runtime</b>\nSearch, read and cite the passages\nfor readers who may read the paper;
stop
@enduml
